  "description": "Composable quality-of-service queues for .NET: FIFO, LIFO, priority, WFQ, CBWFQ, LLQ, and weighted round robin, chainable to arbitrary depth. Alpha; API subject to change.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "QoSKit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-27T16:41:03.64Z",
