  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/jchristn/QoSKit",
  "published": "2026-09-27T16:38:17.48Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Alpha (0.2.1). Fixes: DequeueAsync/ConsumeAsync no longer stall when an LLQ priority class is throttled by its policer and no new traffic arrives (the waiter wakes when the bucket refills); cancelled or faulted waiters forward their wakeup; blocked EnqueueAsync producers wake on Clear or a raised MaxDepth and throw on unknown-class rejection instead of waiting forever; chain pumps and DrainTo remove exactly the item they forwarded (no loss or duplication under concurrent enqueue, policer refill, aging, or WRR deficits); WRR TryPeek now reports the item TryDequeue serves; a policed item costing more than the burst is rate-limited instead of stranded; a disposed sink stops a pump instead of discarding the source. No public API changes. Public API is subject to change between 0.x releases.",
